# Cloudflare Pages response headers for the static frontend (copied to dist/_headers by `vite build`).
# Conservative on purpose: nothing here can change how the app works. A full Content-Security-Policy needs the final API origin
# (connect-src) and is documented in docs/RELEASE_RUNBOOK.md rather than guessed here.
# The microphone stays allowed for this site because the voice assistant uses the browser's speech recognition.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), microphone=(self)
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
